    "body": "In the notebook this warning message is emitted - as we use the default value for display_format. As this message is only emitted when we rely on the default can we explicitly pass in the value we want (maybe we need to change it internally to sparse later but I think thats better than having warnings come out by default from our internal use of our code)\r\n\r\n> /home/runner/work/qiskit-nature/qiskit-nature/qiskit_nature/properties/second_quantization/electronic/integrals/electronic_integrals.py:218: UserWarning: The default value for `display_format` will be changed from 'dense'to 'sparse' in version 0.3.0. Once that happens, you must specifydisplay_format='dense' directly.\r\n\r\n(PS. I fixed for the formatting of the message in #330)",
