    "updated_at": "2021-08-18T07:44:33Z",
    "body": "I have added a truncation method similar to what we did for the `FermionicOp`. However, since we are explicitly listing the matrices as a sparse list, this truncation sets the number of entries to be displayed (i.e. the number of lines for each matrix) rather than limiting the total number of chars to be printed. I think this makes the most sense.",
